  ],
  "instructions": [
    "1. Marinate the tempeh cubes in peanut sauce for at least 30 minutes.",
    "2. Preheat a non-stick pan over medium-high heat. Add the marinated tempeh and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "3. In a separate pan, heat chicken stock over low heat. Add the sliced cucumber, grated carrots, and cooked tempeh.",
    "4. In a large bowl, combine the shredded lettuce, cooked tempeh mixture, and crumbled tofu.",
    "5. Drizzle lime juice over the salad and toss to combine.",
    "6. Garnish with chopped cilantro, if desired.",
    "7. Serve immediately."
  ],
